summary:
  A station is asked about although its standing order was taken down.

history:
  Stop takes the order down at once and the player plays on for the length
  of the fade. A count that runs out inside those 400 ms started a helper
  after the one moment that would have ended it, and the station was held
  for twenty seconds after Stop.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      if (!f || f.on !== true || f.playing !== true || f.wanted !== true) return false;

replace:
      if (!f || f.on !== true || f.playing !== true) return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_nobody_is_listened_to_with_the_option_off_or_nothing_playing
  and tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_no_reading_starts_inside_a_stops_fade.
  Line-neutral.
